 485: **Definition 47.1 (`G_A^{2/pair}`).** Take the total-exact, owner-faithful,
 486: translation/D6, zero-lag candidate grammar of Round-5 Definition 37.1, with
 487: all of its genuine-history, P3, persistence, and terminal obligations. Replace
 488: only its lifetime counter by the following counter: at each real S
 489: `FirstStone`, set the available number of S-coordinate-reactive episodes to
 490: two; charge at most one closed episode to the observed coordinate that
 491: triggered it; after a nonwinning `SecondStone` passes control to F, discard
