 784: 
 785: **S30 objective disposition: NEGATIVE AT A CONDITIONAL MODULE SCOPE; OPEN
 786: globally.**
 787: S44.1 extends S39.1: the natural physical deficit certificate cannot replace
 788: the missing service blockers. It does not prove that an arbitrary carrier ever
