 497: ## 66. The forcing horn: a post-S15 horizon gap
 498: 
 499: ### 66.1 Fast-winner depth
 500: 
 501: Fix an alleged-winning pure shadow second-player strategy `sigma` and a legal
 502: reachable S15 synchronization `h`. Let `d_sigma(h)` be the least integer `n`
 503: such that, against every complete/maximal legal `Shat` counterplay from `h`,
 504: `Fhat` has won within `n` further physical shadow single placements.
