 518: | owner | `Fhat` | `Fhat` | `Shat` | `Shat` | `Fhat` | `Fhat` | `Shat` | `Shat` |
 519: | owner count after append | 3 | 4 | 4 | 5 | 5 | 6 | 6 | 7 |
