 395: ### 76.3 The exact opening-F-pair ingress sieve
 396: 
 397: Condition now on selecting a coupled branch which is live at `q_3`.  Counts
 398: alone give `mu_H>=2` and `mu_R>=3`, and S55 makes the remaining local cases
