 405: | `q_3` state | CAD/admission fact | Actual-pair disposition |
 406: |---|---|---|
 407: | `mu_H=2`, `mu_R>3` | `F-CAD_2^st` is already absent by S55 | failed ingress before the first query; not an `R_1` ejection |
