 503: Consider the S-role portion of one proposed reserve-one rolling cycle.  Just
 504: after its nonterminal F pair, let `p` be the common-live state, let `W_*` be
 505: the designated least real F-unblocked window attaining `mu_R`, and let the
 506: new real-S pair be `Y={y_1,y_2}`.  The shadow pair is written
 507: `Yhat={yhat_1,yhat_2}`.  F stones do not change during this segment.
