tactics.rs  439:     /// placement facts (history rows) but no `HexoState`, so it cannot reach the
tactics.rs  440:     /// board's incremental store. Placements must be pairwise-distinct cells (as
tactics.rs  441:     /// any real game history is); a repeated cell trips the same
