+**Independent recomputation.** S15 starts the F roles at shadow/real counts
+`(2,1)`. Each genuine one-for-one F event raises both counts once, so the
+four pre-query counts are `(2,1)`, `(3,2)`, `(4,3)`, and `(5,4)`. If `z_4`
