+S66's timing follows from the same count lower bound: neither S15 nor the
+first eligible F `FirstStone` checkpoint can meet `RES_1`; an S59-style
+entrance can first occur only after the second F pair and the following S
+pair. S67 correctly reads slow depth only as existence of a genuine
