+| line seed | `F@k_1,F@k_2` | `Fhat@z_1,Fhat@z_2` | S `FirstStone` |
+| guarded pair | `S@y_1,S@y_2` | `Shat@f,Shat@T(y_1)` | F `FirstStone` |
+| prepayment pair | `F@k_3,F@k_4` | `Fhat@z_3,Fhat@z_4` | S `FirstStone` |
